{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Сунан Абу Дауд","section":{"9":"Zakat (Kitab Al-Zakat)"},"section_detail":{"9":{"hadithnumber_first":1556,"hadithnumber_last":1700,"arabicnumber_first":1556,"arabicnumber_last":1700,"name_native":"Книга закята"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1696,"arabicnumber":1696,"text":"Джубайр ибн Мут‘им, да будет доволен им Аллах, передаёт, что Пророк ﷺ сказал: «Не войдёт в Рай порывающий родственные связи»","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (5984) Sahih Muslim (2556)"}],"reference":{"book":9,"hadith":141}}]}